          "tz": 180
        },
        "subject": "LU-18222 quota: enable LQA grace timeout support",
        "message": "LU-18222 quota: enable LQA grace timeout support\n\nAllow to set and show grace timeouts for an LQA. Everything else has\nbeen already implemented, so on the server side it is enough to handle\nthe LUSTRE_Q_SETINFOLQA command in qmt_quotactl().\n\nFix \"lfs quota -t {-U|-G|-P} --lqa LQA_NAME\" to send\nLUSTRE_Q_GETINFOLQA and print the LQA grace periods without a quota\ntitle. Use LQA_NAME and POOL_NAME in the lfs setquota/quota help.\n\nAdd sanity-quota test_3d and test_4c to check block and inode soft\nlimits with grace timeouts for an LQA, and check LQA grace periods in\ntest_97c, including after MDS restart. Move the LQA range calculation\nfrom test_1k to the lqa_get_range() helper.\n\nSigned-off-by: Sergey Cheremencev <scherementsev@ddn.com>\nChange-Id: I2074ca5fcbbdc572fa3f0d51a0b477aa87a61ad5\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
